01:03:20,000 --> 01:03:26,000
Jennifer Lopez: Halftime is a 2022 American Netflix original
documentary film directed by Amanda Micheli.

11
01:09:40,000 --> 01:09:46,000
Its story follows the career of Jennifer Lopez, with a heavy focus on her
performance at the Super Bowl LIV halftime show and her film Hustlers (2019).

12
01:16:00,000 --> 01:16:06,000
The film premiered at the opening night of the 2022 Tribeca Film
Festival, and was released on Netflix on June 14, 2022.

13
01:22:20,000 --> 01:22:26,000
Lopez re-recorded an orchestra version of the song entitled "Same Girl (Halftime Remix)" featuring French Montana along with another
song, a rendition of "This Land Is Your Land" / "America the Beautiful", to coincide with the release of the film.

14
01:28:40,000 --> 01:28:46,000
The film explores themes of pop culture, pop singer, woman director.
